    <string name="permission_foregroundRationaleTitle">Location for local weather</string>
    <string name="permission_foregroundRationale">Tengmo Väder uses your location only to show weather for where you are. It is never sent anywhere except the weather services that answer your request.</string>
    <string name="permission_backgroundRationaleTitle">Keep this widget on your location</string>
    <string name="permission_backgroundRationale">To keep a \"My location\" widget showing weather for wherever you are, even when the app is closed, Android needs \"Allow all the time\" location access. This is only used to refresh that widget — never sent anywhere except the weather services, and never used for anything else.</string>
