    <string name="privacy_storage">This app has no account and no backend server of ours. Your favorite places, last-viewed location, widget choices and display preferences (theme, units, language) are saved only on this device and are never sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="privacy_location">Your location is used only to show weather for where you are. Its coordinates are sent solely to the public weather and place-name services that answer your request (SMHI, Open-Meteo, MET Norway, OpenStreetMap Nominatim), never to us. \"My location\" widgets can keep following your position while the app is closed if you allow background location; it is used for nothing else.</string>
    <string name="privacy_noTracking">The app contains no advertising, no analytics and no tracking identifiers.</string>
